      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town was named after the Duke of Clarence, King George III’s third son, though the reason remains unknown.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www4.erie.gov/clarence/about-our-town",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Clarence was founded as one of the three original towns of Niagara County.",
